{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google本周發佈緊急安全更新修復 Chrome 瀏覽器的 CVE-2026-125350 漏洞，該漏洞屬於零日漏洞範疇，在Google修復漏洞前已經有黑客在野外利用這個漏洞發起攻擊。對Google來説零日漏洞屬於非常糟糕的漏洞類型，所以Google推送緊急安全更新用於封堵漏洞。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585870.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.490975+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"c582f2e05d25871c6fd3378a6b2b55dbfad5157e4b1c4c5c599b5c70973cf6fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}